Source: https://github.com/0xShug0/audio.cpp
Comment: The orig tarball is git archive of v0.9.6 (04a37f2e) without the
 files below. The model weights and audio in assets/, tests/ and webui/
 have licences of their own or none stated; the web UI, notebooks and
 documentation are not used by the library; cpp-httplib (with BoringSSL)
 is only for the model manager, which is not built; lfm_d1_omni carries
 calibration data under the LFM Open License 1.0, which restricts
 commercial use. Of tests/ only perf/ and soulx_flashhead/ stay (code),
 as CMake defines test programs from them even when they are not built.
Files-Excluded: assets webui Notebooks docs flake.nix flake.lock
